  "about": "The epistola of the formulary “Low Sunday” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "Beloved: Everyone who has been born of God overcomes the world. And this is the victory that overcomes the world: our faith. Who overcomes the world but the one who believes that Jesus is the Son of God? This is the One who came through water and blood, Jesus Christ: not in water alone, but in water and blood. And the Spirit bears witness, because Christ is the truth. For there are three who bear witness in heaven: the Father, the Word, and the Holy Spirit. And these three are one. And there are three who bear witness on earth: the Spirit, water, and blood; and these three are one. If we accept human testimony, God’s testimony is greater, because this is God’s testimony, which is greater: for He has testified about His Son. Whoever believes in the Son of God has God’s testimony within themselves.", "alignments": [{ "words": ["w002", "w003"], "anchor": "w002", "gloss": "Everyone who" }, { "words": ["w004", "w005"], "anchor": "w004", "gloss": "has been born" }, { "words": ["w017", "w018"], "anchor": "w017", "gloss": "our faith" }, { "words": ["w061", "w062"], "anchor": "w062", "gloss": "there are three" }, { "words": ["w064", "w065"], "anchor": "w065", "gloss": "bear witness" }, { "words": ["w071", "w072"], "anchor": "w071", "gloss": "the Holy Spirit" }, { "words": ["w076", "w077"], "anchor": "w077", "gloss": "are one" }, { "words": ["w079", "w080"], "anchor": "w080", "gloss": "there are three" }, { "words": ["w082", "w083"], "anchor": "w083", "gloss": "bear witness" }, { "words": ["w094", "w095"], "anchor": "w095", "gloss": "are one" }, { "words": ["w102", "w103"], "anchor": "w103", "gloss": "is greater" }, { "words": ["w110", "w111"], "anchor": "w111", "gloss": "is greater" }, { "words": ["w113", "w114"], "anchor": "w113", "gloss": "He has testified" }, { "words": ["w116", "w117"], "anchor": "w116", "gloss": "His Son" }] }
  },
